  "bodyHash": "3dd72a267cd3d7f3",
  "content": "\n\n<h1><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1392578/description_fc149069-4bab-4ff2-8ccd-531bbc321b42.png\" width=\"547\" height=\"372\"></strong></span></h1>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>开发中！</strong></span></h1>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#fff\">《泰坦世界》是一款为你的游戏添加全新且强大怪物的模组。这些怪物被称为泰坦。你还可以使用变形系统变成泰坦。本模组目前处于测试阶段，可能会出现漏洞。</span></h1>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#fff\">此外，配置文件位于：&nbsp;</span></h1>\n<h1><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#fff\">.minecraft\\config\\titansmod-config</span></h1>\n<h1><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\"><u>本模组需要以下前置：</u></span></strong><br><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">- TitansApi (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/titans-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/titans-api</a>)</span></strong><br><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">- AttributeFix (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/attributefix\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/attributefix</a>)</span></strong></h1>\n<h1><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\"><u>此外，为了优化性能，我推荐安装：</u></span></strong><br><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">- Rubidium (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rubidium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rubidium</a>)</span></strong></h1>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#fff\">模组特色：</span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2f57ceb6-6b40-4723-ad77-6c088b6662c7.png\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_058632af-c11e-4391-ab1b-f44293d79f07.png\" width=\"414\" height=\"799\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_5521435a-f8d0-49e3-b38b-45c461e9a193.png\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_36ccea2e-7bbc-4701-a538-af6c0f0aad86.png\" width=\"425\" height=\"678\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_10c291f6-15d4-4b89-8dff-8ce83b54353a.png\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_660fbe3c-3329-4052-b0f1-1bcf32e7e507.png\" width=\"435\" height=\"997\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_6e97fde3-a157-4d98-8695-ef46870f12d9.png\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_485a6be0-bafa-4a6f-8b1a-0007de7d95e7.png\" width=\"492\" height=\"626\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1392578/description_f06548e8-05a3-4ba5-8a5a-a2ed189844f1.png\" width=\"436\" height=\"61\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1392578/description_65715b43-600b-473a-824b-642869b40fd0.png\" width=\"503\" height=\"452\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><strong>化身泰坦！</strong></h1>\n<p><em><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">史莱姆泰坦</span></em></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1392578/description_bc448e5d-5204-496e-adbd-bca47402a87c.gif\"></p>\n<p><em><span style=\"color:#fff\">恶魂泰坦</span></em></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1392578/description_1d3e5be4-48e8-473a-8c31-338975314b25.gif\"></p>\n<p><em>蠹虫泰坦</em></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1392578/description_a7074dd2-2a35-4674-9471-a5259e108d9c.gif\"></p>\n<h1><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>每种化身都拥有专属的自定义技能！</strong></span></em></h1>\n<h1><strong>全新的设置选项！</strong></h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1392578/description_c08ee447-e204-419c-be76-4911dad3f79e.gif\"></p>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>全新的护甲与工具！</strong></span></h1>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1392578/description_6d1efb47-3da6-4cbc-b089-dff9c45f7e5c.png\"></strong></span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1392578/description_a57abcaa-06bf-44b4-842c-513802723a89.png\" width=\"535\" height=\"806\"></strong></span></p>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>本模组适用于 Forge 1.20.1 版本</strong></span></h1>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>展示视频：</strong></span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1392578/description_5c7b4dbf-e012-4897-8d0e-fe62aa99de95.png\" width=\"312\" height=\"213\"></strong></span></p>\n<h1><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fSlRubfTWxI\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fSlRubfTWxI</a></span></h1>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>注意事项：</strong></span></h1>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>《泰坦世界》是一款原创模组，并非 1.7.10 版本《泰坦模组》的复制、重制或移植版本。</strong></span><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>所有武器、建筑、原声音乐、矿石、泰坦能力、AI行为以及变形系统均为独立设计与实现。《泰坦世界》仅仅代表了我对巨型强力生物的个人构想。</strong></span></h1>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1392578/description_1a4ef5dd-683b-4118-b1a5-42ece3fe6d1d.png\"></strong></span></h2>\n<h2><em><span style=\"color:#fff\">即将添加更多泰坦：<strong><br>- 烈焰人泰坦<br>- 远古守卫者泰坦<br>- 末影螨泰坦<br>- 唤魔者泰坦<br>- 疣猪兽泰坦<br>- 岩浆怪泰坦<br>- 猪灵泰坦<br>- 幻翼泰坦<br>- 劫掠兽泰坦<br>- 潜影贝泰坦<br>- 恼鬼泰坦<br>- 凋灵骷髅泰坦<br>- 监守者泰坦<br>- 凋灵泰坦<br>- 末影龙泰坦</strong></span></em></h2>\n<h1><em><span style=\"color:#fff\">计划添加：<br><strong>- &nbsp;为所有泰坦添加变形系统。</strong><br><strong>- &nbsp;更多护甲、矿石和工具。</strong><br><strong>- &nbsp;调整模组以适配生存模式。</strong><br><strong>- &nbsp;修复卡顿问题并提升优化效果。</strong></span></em></h1>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#fff\">以上就是全部内容。</span></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>如果遇到问题或有建议添加的内容，请在评论区留言！</strong></span></h1>",
